# [[.Name]] — a scantor task ([[.Language]])

This folder is a scantor task. The definition lives in `main.go`; `scantor.yaml` is the manifest.

Commands:
- `scantor validate .` — static checks, image build, describe and type check (as on publish)
- `scantor dev run . --limit 5` — build and run locally (add `--remote` to run on the platform)
- `scantor dev debug .` — run one analysis and wait for a debugger
- `scantor push .` — upload and publish a revision
- `scantor scans start [[.Name]]@latest` — start a scan of the latest revision

Rules: keep `name` in scantor.yaml unchanged; `schedule` must be deterministic; put large outputs in
`ctx.Files()`; return `scantor.Fatal` for permanent and `scantor.Retry` for transient failures.

Go: config structs give every field a default with a `jsonschema:"default=…"` tag (configs reject
unknown keys); pointer fields are nullable; keep the `replace` directive of the connector in `go.mod`;
`go vet ./...` must pass, because `scantor validate` and publishing run it.

Guide: https://github.com/lonetis/scantor/blob/v[[.Version]]/docs/guide/authoring-[[.Language]].md
